00:05:45.378 --> 00:05:48.715 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et le même niveau de raffinement

00:05:46.613 --> 00:05:49.950 size:53% position:73% line:53%
quant au développement de

00:05:47.814 --> 00:05:51.151 size:53% position:73% line:53%
politiques, quant aux détails

00:05:49.049 --> 00:05:52.385 size:53% position:73% line:53%
