00:05:50.283 --> 00:05:53.620 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Donc, on a vu qu'un service

00:05:51.484 --> 00:06:00.460 size:53% position:73% line:53%
comme celui que la loi nous

00:05:52.719 --> 00:06:01.661 size:53% position:73% line:53%
demande de fournir est très

00:05:53.953 --> 00:06:02.862 size:53% position:73% line:53%
