00:06:00.794 --> 00:06:04.097 size:53% position:73% line:53%
politiques qui n'ont pas...

00:06:01.995 --> 00:06:12.339 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qui n'ont pas la capacité

00:06:03.196 --> 00:06:13.006 size:53% position:73% line:53%
